{"data":{"batches":["App: Preferences. Window: Settings.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | option | Light | top left | on\n2 | option | Dark | top left | off\n3 | option | Auto | top | off\n4 | search field | Search | top right\n5 | slider | Volume | top right\n6 | tabs | Tabs | top\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Preferences and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label.","App: Preferences. Window: Settings.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | group of 4 buttons | General, Tabs, Privacy, Advanced | top | Tabs\n2 | text area | Notes | center\n3 | menu button | Actions | center | tip: More things to do\n4 | group of 3 buttons | 7, 8, 9 | right\n5 | group of 3 buttons | +, -, = | right\n6 | group of 4 links | Home, Documentation, Changelog, Contact | bottom left\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Preferences and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label.","App: Preferences. Window: Settings.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | button | Zoom in | bottom left\n2 | disclosure arrow | Details | bottom\n3 | button | Fit | bottom\n4 | button | Zoom out | bottom\n5 | stepper | Quantity | bottom right\n6 | color picker | Colour | bottom right\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Preferences and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label.","App: Preferences. Window: Settings.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | combo box | Font | bottom right | shows Helvetica\n2 | button | Actual size | bottom right\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Preferences and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label."],"cached":false,"prompt":"App: Preferences. Window: Settings.\nVisible items (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n0 | menu | File | top left\n1 | option | Light | top left | on\n2 | option | Dark | top left | off\n3 | option | Auto | top | off\n4 | search field | Search | top right\n5 | slider | Volume | top right\n6 | button | General | top left | Tabs\n7 | button | Tabs | top left | Tabs\n8 | tabs | Tabs | top\n9 | button | Privacy | top | Tabs\n10 | button | Advanced | top | Tabs\n11 | text area | Notes | center\n12 | button | 7 | center\n13 | button | 8 | right\n14 | button | 9 | right\n15 | button | + | right\n16 | button | - | right\n17 | button | = | right\n18 | link | Home | left | goes to / on this site\n19 | link | Documentation | left | goes to /docs on this site\n20 | menu button | Actions | center | tip: More things to do\n21 | link | Contact | bottom left | goes to /contact on this site\n22 | link | Changelog | bottom left | goes to /changes on this site\n23 | disclosure arrow | Details | bottom\n24 | stepper | Quantity | bottom right\n25 | color picker | Colour | bottom right\n26 | LevelIndicator | Gauge | bottom\n27 | combo box | Font | bottom right | shows Helvetica\n28 | button | Fit | bottom\n29 | button | Zoom in | bottom left\n30 | button | Zoom out | bottom\n31 | button | Actual size | bottom right\nWrite an overview of this window: what it is, what it is showing right now, and what someone can do here as a whole. Each button is explained separately afterwards.","request":"p1"},"ok":true}
